{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2022-06-28 20:00:00', 'title': 'CLIMATE IMPACT X SELECTS NASDAQ TECHNOLOGY TO POWER NEW GLOBAL CARBON EXCHANGE', 'text': "NEW YORK AND SINGAPORE, JUNE 28, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NASDAQ (NASDAQ: NDAQ) AND CLIMATE IMPACT X (CIX), A GLOBAL MARKETPLACE AND EXCHANGE FOR QUALITY CARBON CREDITS, TODAY ANNOUNCED A STRATEGIC TECHNOLOGY PARTNERSHIP THAT WILL HELP UNLOCK PRICE TRANSPARENCY AND LIQUIDITY IN THE VOLUNTARY CARBON MARKET. THE AGREEMENT WILL SEE CIX LEVERAGE NASDAQ'S ROBUST MATCHING TECHNOLOGY TO POWER ITS SPOT TRADING PLATFORM, WHICH WILL LAUNCH IN EARLY 2023 FOR FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS AND INSTITUTIONAL INVESTORS WORLDWIDE."}